WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:10.800
The imperial family of the Abh Empire consists of eight royal families.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:09.660
Scirh Family - Néïc Ramaral

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:12.200
Ïrich Family - Néïc Dïishil

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:14.770
Lasisec Family - Néïc Ramrïural

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:17.620
These families, all using the name Abriel are descended from the siblings and children of Emperor Dounei, the founder.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:17.340
Üescoc Family - Néïc Daiuüél

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:19.870
Barcéc Family - Néïc Ramusal

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:22.510
Balgzédéc Family - Néïc Dïubzél

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:23.290
Everyone born in these 8 royal families is destined to serve in the military

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:25.180
Chülgzédéc Family - Néïc Dïuaséc

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:34.120
Crybh Family - Néïc Dubreuscr

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:29.230
and participate in a severe competition to claim for the jade throne.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:37.660
Ablïarsec néïc Dubreuscr Bœrh Parhynr Lamhirh is also one of these contenders.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.540
Listen, Baron. This is a mission.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.410
You do realize how sacred a mission is.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.470
Should anything happen to Jinto, I will not forgive you.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.280
Your Highness!

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.910
Her Highness is very tired!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.820
Show her to her room!

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:33.630
Raumechoth Raifa

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:33.630
Fortunate Revolt

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.730
I see you're awake, young man.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:54.630
Who are you?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:59.070
You should introduce yourself before you ask for someone's name.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.980
I'm Linn Ssynec Rocr Ïarlucec Dreuc Haïder Ghintec.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.840
You're a Count? I wouldn't have guessed.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.550
But you hardly look like an Abh.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.250
Neither do you.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:20.590
I'm Atosryac Ssynec Atosr Lymh Raica Feubdach Srumh.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.600
Then you're the present Baron's...

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.730
I'm his father.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.300
What's the big idea?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.700
Calm down, young man.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:36.470
It seems that my son has done something, but I have no idea.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:38.810
I'm not in the mood for jokes.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.480
I'm not kidding you.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.850
Lafiel...

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.720
Where's Lafiel?

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.950
Am I the only one brought here?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.020
Wasn't there a girl as well?

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.490
A girl?

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.830
No, you were the only one.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:58.540
This girl you're talking about, is she your girlfriend?

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:00.340
My clyuno is missing.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.410
My son likely had something to do with that too.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:08.140
Please take me to your son immediately!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.510
That would be impossible, young man.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.310
Why is that?!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:15.320
Because I'm confined here by my son.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.380
What?!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.360
Jinto... Jinto...

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:26.990
<i>The clyuno you're calling is presently not being worn.</i>

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:33.730
Show me my current position.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:38.300
Show me where the Baron's room is.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.670
How about the guestrooms?

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.810
Which ones are presently occupied?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.780
Are any of them used for confinement?

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.780
<i>I do not understand your question.</i>

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:55.590
Tell me the names of everyone here and their locations.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.420
<i>I cannot do that without the approval of our master.</i>

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.900
<i>Do you wish to get approval?</i>

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:02.720
<i>Please note-</i>

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:03.230
Forget it.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.370
Can I get to the spaceport?

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:10.110
Is there a pressurized route...

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.470
...to the moored transfer shuttle?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:13.980
<i>Yes, there is.</i>

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.300
Is the route closed?

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.710
<i>It is not closed...</i>

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.780
<i>...but an electromagnetic crest key is required.</i>

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.920
Is my electromagnetic crest registered?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.620
<i>No.</i>

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.280
Can I register it now?

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.720
<i>I cannot do that without the approval of our master.</i>

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.690
<i>Do you wish to get approval?</i>

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:35.550
<i>Please note that the master is presently resting-</i>

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:38.030
Whose electromagnetic crests are registered?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.060
<i>Our master and all of the vassals.</i>

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.190
<i>The vassals' names are-</i>

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.020
Forget it!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.480
The Baron's father is here, right?

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:57.280
<i>Yes. The former Baron resides in this spaceport.</i>

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:01.120
Is the electromagnetic crest of the Baron's father registered?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.320
<i>No. It is not registered.</i>

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.890
Why is that?

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.760
<i>By order of our master.</i>

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.270
Tell me why the Baron gave such orders.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.700
<i>I cannot do that without the approval of our master.</i>

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.470
<i>Do you wish to get approval?</i>

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.620
<i>Please note that the master is-</i>

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.760
I've heard that line already.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.280
Tell me where the former Baron is.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.970
I want to meet with the former Baron.

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:24.780
You shall arrange an appointment.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.340
<i>I cannot do that without the approval of our master.</i>

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:29.750
<i>Do you wish to get approval?</i>

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:30.490
No I don't!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.330
<i>Please note...</i>

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:35.180
Why do I need permission from the Baron to meet his father?

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.460
That doesn't make sense.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.890
<i>I do not have an answer.</i>

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:38.950
Naturally.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.830
Is there anyone else...

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.420
...present in the area occupied by the former Baron?

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.260
<i>Yes. One other person.</i>

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.630
What's that person's name?!

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.340
<i>The name has not been registered.</i>

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.140
That person's not a vassal, right?

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.470
<i>Correct.</i>

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:55.240
Would I need a valid electromagnetic crest...

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.270
...to get to the former Baron's quarters?

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.910
<i>In addition to an electromagnetic crest...</i>

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.550
<i>...you will need the approval of our master.</i>

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.320
<i>Do you wish-</i>

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.480
There's no need to continue.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.460
Confined?

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.760
That's right.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.030
I'm given everything I need...

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:14.900
...but I'm not free.

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:19.840
There's no other word to describe it than "confined".

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:23.570
But the Baron is your son, isn't he?

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:26.440
That's precisely why.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:30.980
He's not happy that I'm genetically a terran.

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:33.110
He doesn't want others to see me...

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:36.680
...or at least, the vassals to see me...

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.850
...so he keeps me confined.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.620
You're confusing me even more.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:44.100
He's got a severe inferiority complex.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:47.250
The history of the Faibdacr family is still very short.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:51.070
Only three generations ago, the family had no warrior rank.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.400
He's always been quite upset about that fact.

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:57.500
His decision to confine me...

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:01.100
...is likely also a result of that.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:05.240
He can't stand the sight of his terran father.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:08.540
It seems he has a problem with me too.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:11.980
Since being locked in here...

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.490
...I've reflected on where I had gone wrong...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.590
...in raising my son.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:18.530
I've had plenty of time to think.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:23.300
I could give you advice on raising children if you wish.

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:24.890
Maybe later.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.730
But first, I must get out of here.

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.000
Don't push it, young man.

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:33.030
Or rather, Your Excellency Count Haïder.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.810
But I haven't got time...

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:40.580
How many hours was I unconscious?

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.050
Since you were brought here...

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:45.350
...it's been about five hours.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.560
Five hours...

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.450
Your Highness!

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:56.890
Your name's...

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.300
...Sernaic, right?

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.430
Yes.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:03.200
I am so honored, Your Highness!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:07.370
You remembered the name of a lowly person like myself.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.970
Where to? Your Highness?

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.720
To my shuttle!

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:13.880
Oh!

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.180
I'm terribly sorry to say this...

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:19.990
...but our master asks that you stay away from the shuttle...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.430
Our master said...

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:29.230
Wait, please, Your Highness.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.760
Please...

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.200
Please...

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.760
Your Highness?

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:39.270
Your Highness?!

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.340
Your Highness!

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.710
You mustn't!

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.010
Your Highness!

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:52.490
But our master asks that you...

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.360
...stay away from the transfer shuttle.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.320
What are you hesitating for, Clüarh.

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.640
Your decision is correct.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.810
There is nothing to fear.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.840
You've spoken your mind...

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.070
...to a real Abh, a princess, no less.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.980
There's no doubt the enemy is the Four Nations Alliance.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.950
Should they come here...

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:25.390
...do you think they'd leave this domain alone?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.390
Not likely.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.320
So then...

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:32.220
...why not negotiate trading the princess...

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.360
...for the safety of the domain?

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.830
I'll try and stall on the negotiations.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.670
But I'll cooperate with them.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:45.510
I'll convert this domain into a Four Nations Alliance base.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.140
Once it becomes an important base...

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.110
...they won't push me around.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.080
However...

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:54.710
...what if my ties with the Empire are broken...

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.880
...and the enemy doesn't come?

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.130
That would be the best outcome.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:09.130
My dream is to build a kingdom of my own.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.300
In every sense...

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:14.640
...I'll become the absolute ruler of this small world.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.670
I don't need any more than the fifty vassals.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.700
I can live on bio-meat alone.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.320
I can live without Semryush apple cider.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:30.350
As long as I hold onto this world and rule with absolute power.

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:35.150
I know...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.060
A kingdom...

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.390
...will need a successor.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:43.390
I'll have the princess give birth to a successor.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:47.930
What is it?!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.580
<i>This is Grieda from housekeeping.</i>

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:55.770
<i>I'm terribly sorry to disturb your rest...</i>

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.480
<i>...but we have an intruder in the transfer shuttle.</i>

00:11:58.680 --> 00:11:59.980
<i>What shall we do?</i>

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:01.440
What?!

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:16.270
Sernaic.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:16.770
Yes!

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.170
I want you to take me to Jinto.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.930
Mr. Jinto?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.700
Oh, that person...

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:25.570
He's being confined by the Baron.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:26.870
Confined?!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.170
By our master?!

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.810
You know where the former Baron is?

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.710
Yes, but... Uh...

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:37.210
I need approval from our master to enter the number 3 quarters.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:40.250
Take me there right away!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.420
That would be impossible.

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:43.690
Is there any place I can call him?

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.720
Only from housekeeping, but they too...

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.560
Then let's take it over.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.760
You and I.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:56.400
Your Highness and myself?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.310
Do you know how to use this?

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:00.810
It's easy.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:04.810
We have no time.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.440
B-But...

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:07.780
Sernaic.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.650
While you may be the Baron's vassal...

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:12.750
...you're also a citizen of the Empire.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.560
Is it more important to wash his back for the rest of your life?

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:19.790
Or to pour the Baron his wine?

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:21.500
Or...

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:24.790
...will you help save our Laburec mission?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.030
With me?

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.570
Well, I...

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.550
I will abide by your orders, Your Highness.

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:41.450
I thank you greatly.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:43.250
You are too kind.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:44.920
Your Highness!

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.050
What is it?!

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.530
I have a petition to make to you.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.050
Go ahead.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.320
If I act against my master's orders...

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.390
...I won't be able to remain.

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.990
Please include me among your vassals, Your Highness.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.330
But I have no vassals serving me.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.940
You're kidding!

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:03.440
Of course...

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:06.440
...there are many vassals serving the Crybh family.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.670
It is my father who chooses vassals...

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:10.840
...but I'll put in a word for you.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.420
I am truly honored!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.440
You can stop groveling.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.250
Groveling, Your Highness?

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:28.260
Hey, hey. I don't know why you're in such a hurry...

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.390
...but you surely have an hour or two.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:35.740
How about just relaxing for a while, Your Excellency.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:40.710
Could you take it easy on the "Your Excellency" bit?

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:43.180
I'm not too comfortable with it.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:49.180
It looks like you've got problems of your own.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.650
Just the same, a count has...

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.750
...the rank of a feudal lord.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:59.320
My own mother did pretty well for a terran...

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:02.770
...but straight from citizen to count?

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.390
I don't know if it was your father or mother...

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.730
...but it worked for you.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.770
It was my father.

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:13.380
My father wasn't even a citizen of the Empire.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.610
He sure pulled it off.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.810
Could you tell me about him?

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.120
I'm...

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.710
I'm sorry, but...

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.460
Is that so?

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:27.790
Well, I've gotta respect your wishes.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.760
There's not one window I could get out from.

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.160
Of course not.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.260
Even if there was, this area is surrounded with bio-farms...

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.740
...so you'll see nothing that'll lift your spirits.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:46.680
In outer space, it's more practical not to have windows.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.110
This is awesome.

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:55.380
Wait a minute.

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:58.080
Where have you been all your life to be impressed...

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.280
...by such a common device.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.260
It's not the device I'm impressed with.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.420
I'm amazed by this fascinating scenery.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.930
I misunderstood then.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.500
Is this Abh illusionary art?

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:16.000
Oh, do you know about it?

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:19.370
I truly believe that nothing reflects...

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.440
...the pride of the Abh more than this scenery.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:27.410
One can keep one's dignity to oneself.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.720
There's no need to go around telling everyone.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:33.190
However, that unworthy son.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:38.530
Rather than stand tall on the mountains, he avoids them...

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.760
...by digging deep valleys...

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:44.200
...satisfied that he's placed himself high above.

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.670
Uh, Your Excellency...

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:47.830
Oh, right.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:51.500
You haven't got time for this, have you, young man?

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:54.170
Are there no communicators in here?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.280
Well, there is one...

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:58.810
...but only connected to housekeeping.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:02.680
I doubt they'll transfer you to that girl you were talking about.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.160
Then how about one of us pretending to get sick?

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:10.290
If I were to act sick just after you'd arrived here...

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.820
...they'd get awfully suspicious.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.920
Let's just say I'm prone to illness.

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:21.500
I wonder if my son would even care if you were dead or alive.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.360
Please take me there anyway.

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:26.910
If only I can get through to her, she could...

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.040
You have confidence in her.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:33.070
She must be a special girl.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.940
She's a...

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.520
...princess of the Empire.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:39.650
You don't say!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.520
Stay exactly where you are!

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:46.600
This section is now under the Laburec's control!

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.560
I demand that you connect me to the former Baron.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.400
That's prohibited.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.470
Forget about the Baron's orders. And hurry up!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.930
Don't move! Kuhaspia!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:01.110
How dare you!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:13.120
What's going on, Sernaic?!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.790
Listen, Alisa!

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.660
Her Highness is taking me as her vassal...

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:18.220
Hurry up!

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:23.100
You're serious, Your Highness.

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:27.070
I don't shoot people for fun.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:31.810
I understand.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.520
What's the matter, Your Highness?!

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:44.710
You've come at the perfect time, Baron.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.260
You will cooperate.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.020
What are you waiting for? Protect me!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.890
I can't believe it!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:00.230
You're pointing your guns at Her Highness!

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.700
Sernaic!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.670
You little traitor!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:09.080
Citizen Sernaic is under my protection.

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:11.210
Your Highness!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.220
I... I couldn't be more fortunate!

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.750
Your Highness, you're overstepping your authority.

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.220
I've welcomed you with open arms.

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:21.920
In that case you shall let us go.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.050
I cannot allow that.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.020
I will rescue Jinto...

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.620
...even without your help.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.090
I'll just have to slice this spaceport apart.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.930
All right.

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:34.940
I'm an Abh nobleman, I will not submit to threats.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.070
You can try whatever you wish.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.570
Master!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.770
Please wait!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.020
You always were the Baron's favorite!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.770
Your Highness, we're connected!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.800
Is this Baron Faibdacr senior?

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.200
<i>Lafiel?</i>

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.240
Jinto!

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:15.040
Are you all right?!

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.810
Yeah, somehow.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.310
How about you?

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:19.740
I'm okay.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.110
Be careful, Jinto.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:25.350
The Baron could be on his way.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.880
<i>What? For what?</i>

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:32.020
You always seem oblivious to the dangers around you.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.560
I think he wants to kill you.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.790
What should I do about it?

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:38.990
We've got no weapons here.

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.300
<i>Can you somehow escape?</i>

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.840
I'm at a total loss without you around.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.070
<i>I suppose.</i>

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:47.440
Not yet?

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:48.570
I'm trying...

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:53.580
What is it?

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.120
It won't open!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.250
The control room's taken over all functions!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:01.290
Did you hear that, Jinto?

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:04.380
It seems the Baron doesn't have the time...

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:06.090
...to go and kill you.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.260
<i>That's a shame.</i>

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:09.430
I'm terribly sorry, Your Highness.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:12.460
I can't do anything about access to the number 3 quarters.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:13.530
Bring up a map.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.330
Yes.

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:21.240
Lafiel?

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:22.250
<i>Jinto!</i>

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>Can you see the ceiling from there?</i>

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.660
Look straight at its center!

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.430
Why, it's...!

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.130
It's a hatch!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.540
Of course, the dock.

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:50.400
You guys have a shuttle, don't you?

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:51.170
A dock?

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:53.140
Out there?

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:57.170
This was once a departure and arrival hall for VlPs.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:01.920
They got rid of the elevator, so it now opens directly into space.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:04.350
I'll bring the shuttle there.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:07.590
We'll depart as soon as you get on.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.350
<i>But the Baron has the transfer shuttle...</i>

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.960
It doesn't belong to the Baron.

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:14.600
It's a Laburec shuttle!

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:21.160
I'll be waiting.

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:27.310
Are you sure you two aren't in love with each other?

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:28.470
Not a chance.

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:31.410
There aren't many in the Empire who can...

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.680
...call Her Highness by her name.

00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:36.410
Let's just say it was...

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:42.020
...a feat achieved through ignorance and good luck.

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:46.720
Well, that sounds like a fascinating story too.

00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:53.730
<i>I still had no idea...</i>

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:58.340
<i>...that a genuine princess who chanced upon this star...</i>

00:22:58.380 --> 00:23:02.810
<i>...was about to trigger a major incident all on her own.</i>

00:24:30.270 --> 00:24:33.500
A struggle has erupted on this baronial spaceport.

00:24:33.540 --> 00:24:35.560
Can I really trust you women?

00:24:35.610 --> 00:24:36.900
It is regrettable...

00:24:36.940 --> 00:24:37.570
I see.

00:24:37.840 --> 00:24:38.930
Of course you can, Master.

00:24:53.360 --> 00:24:55.950
Well done, Baron.

00:24:57.190 --> 00:24:59.810
Next episode

00:24:57.190 --> 00:24:59.810
The Way of the Abh

00:24:57.190 --> 00:24:59.810
Bar Garhath
